{"id":"desaparicio_n","lemma":"desaparición","pos":"noun","rank":2809,"glosses":["disappearance","demise"],"ipa":"/desapaɾiˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"desapariciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/61/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desaparici%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Debemos investigar la desaparición de aquel médico.","en":"We have to look into the disappearance of the doctor.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to investigate"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"that (over there"},{"g":"doctor"}]},{"text":"Reportamos su desaparición.","en":"We reported his disappearance.","words":[null,{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"La desaparición de Tom completamente desconcertó a la policía.","en":"Tom's disappearance completely baffled the police.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804597","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"completely"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"Civility"}]},{"text":"¿Tienes alguna idea acerca del porqué de la desaparición de Tom?","en":"Do you have any idea why Tom disappeared?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801990","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"idea"},{"g":"only used in acerca de…"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"a reason"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"of the"]]},{"text":"Tom denunció la desaparición de Mary.","en":"Tom reported Mary missing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/80171","words":[null,{"g":"to denounce","l":"denunciar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},null]}]}